{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "動詞のて形いただきます。これだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476299.6417243}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "その行為は相手になってしまいます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476301.6737034}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "担当していただきますだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476306.6483414}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に依頼する表現になってしまうので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476310.3467226}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ここは注意が必要です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476311.4690244}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自分の行為の場合は使役", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476315.6452563}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "でいただきますを使いましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476318.7332203}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、それでは会話です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476323.7967548}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "次の会話は、担当交代の挨拶の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783476326.758326}
